# The source dataset never enters the image. It is real insurance PII,
# gitignored, and both specs commit to it being "supplied at run time; not
# committed" — plan.md names "Source CSV stays out of the repository" as a
# constraint. It reaches the container through the read-only bind mount in
# docker-compose.yml instead, so it is present when mounted and absent
# from every image layer.
data/
specs/

.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.log
*.tmp
